   "text": "Build the analog prototype, the filter you copy, with its cutoff there. Then squeeze. Its whole stretch up to the cutoff lands below thirty-four hundred, and that stretch is nearly flat. The technician measures again: seventy point seven percent at thirty-four hundred hertz. You changed one number. That's the whole fix.",
